Subject: [PATCH 5.2 039/313] ASoC: sgtl5000: Fix of unmute outputs on probe
Date:   Thu,  3 Oct 2019 17:50:17 +0200
Message-Id: <20191003154537.075912544@linuxfoundation.org>
